@startuml sd-03-plan-preview
!include ../_style/cue.iuml
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
autonumber "<b>00"
title SD-3  Motion plan preview and confirmation — the instruction is optional (FR-04, FR-05)
actor "User" as U #E3F0FB
participant "React SPA" as SPA #E3F0FB
participant "FastAPI" as API #E6F4EA
participant "Plan interpreter\n(local LLM + rule validator)" as PLN #F1E8FB

U -> SPA : type English instruction (optional)
alt instruction is empty
  note over SPA, PLN : No call is made. Language model is NOT used.\n"Generate animation" is enabled directly (drawings-only run).
else instruction typed
  U -> SPA : click "Preview plan"
  SPA -> API : POST /plans/preview {command}
  activate API
  API -> API : session check; length limit
  API -> PLN : interpret(command)
  activate PLN
  alt service down or timeout
    PLN --> API : error
    API --> SPA : 503 plan service unavailable
    SPA --> U : message; drawings-only generation still possible
  else answered
    PLN -> PLN : LLM proposes structured plan;\nrule validator checks schema and vocabulary
    alt plan rejected (unsupported, ambiguous, negative command ...)
      PLN --> API : rejected + reason
      API --> SPA : 422 reason
      SPA --> U : reasoned rejection; text stays editable
    else plan valid
      PLN --> API : plan JSON + schema version
      deactivate PLN
      API --> SPA : 200 plan (NOT stored)
      SPA --> U : cue sheet (events, order, speed)
      U -> SPA : tick "This plan is correct"
      note over SPA : Approval is client state. Editing the text clears it\nand marks the plan "out of date".
    end
  end
  deactivate API
end
note over SPA, API : The plan and approval time are persisted only when the job is submitted (SD-4a).
@enduml
